  may weaken    tests/welcome-header.test.ts: edits a test file; compared with the request's start
  not proved    NOTICE: no proof covers it; the project's commands pass with it; compared with the request's start
  not proved    src/tesota.ts: no proof covers it; the project's commands pass with it; compared with the request's start
