  changed lines implementation +99 -18 · tests +75 -25 · other +7 -0 · compared with the request's start
  model listed  no case the request leaves open, by openai/gpt-6-sol; a model's opinion, not a check
From 700f9a9d4a0b · Tesota 0.1.0-alpha.1 · openai/gpt-6.1-sol

Request clarification (operator input, not evidence or acceptance)
Agent question: Issue #584 requires real-terminal dark/light screenshots or a recording in the PR. Can you provide that visual evidence? I can run automated terminal tests here, but cannot inspect a real terminal window.
Operator selected: Open PR with gap noted — Open the PR with real-terminal visual acceptance explicitly pending.

